  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    n1[\"1. open auto popover\"]\n    n2[\"2. open hint popover\"] --> n3[\"3. showModal()\"]\n```\n\nWhen the dialog inside the hint popover is shown, should the unrelated auto popover hide? The spec says yes, but it currently fails in Firefox and Chrome.\n\nIt feels like the spec is right here, but I wanted to check.\n\ncc @keithamus @mfreed7 @nt1m \n\nTest: http://wpt.live/html/semantics/popovers/popover-hint-dialog-dismisses-unrelated-auto.html\n",
